<title>HUNGARY: Ibusz group swings to '96 pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Ibusz group swings to '96 pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-Dec 1996     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating result	 11.0 loss   vs   451.9 profit</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax result	   40.5 profit vs   292.2 loss</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     4,020.1	  vs 5,462.7</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	   105.6	  vs 1,086.7</p>
<p>    Material expenditures     2,748.7	  vs  3,551.5</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	742.6	  vs    845.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    128.3	  vs    130.6</p>
<p>    Other costs		     359.4	  vs    844.9</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    157.7	  vs    724.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   39.1 profit vs    442.6 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	   207.5	  vs    189.4</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure     168.4	  vs    632.1</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income     12.4 profit vs    301.5 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue     104.8	  vs    672.2</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.	92.5	  vs    973.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Ibusz is a travel group. The figures are consolidated. The figures were prepared in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards. The 1996 figures are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
